re.\n\n*  **Material Swap:** See your kitchen with marble countertops, your living room with hardwood floors, or your bedroom with new wall colors \u2014 all rendered live in your actual space.\n\n*  **Room Makeover:** Describe your vision \u2014 \"mid-century modern living room\" or \"minimalist Scandinavian kitchen\" \u2014 and watch Aria Spark generate a complete redesign overlaid on your real room.\n\n*   **Before & After:** Capture and compare your current space against proposed changes. Share screenshots with your designer, contractor, or partner.\n\n*   **Virtual Staging:** Stage an empty listing with virtual furniture in minutes. Walk buyers through a fully furnished space without moving a single piece.\n\n*   **Renovation Planning:** Show buyers the potential of a fixer-upper with live material swaps and layout changes during the showing.", "short_description": "See It Before You Build It. Aria Spark transforms your Meta Quest into a spatial design studio. Powered by AI and real-time depth mapping, it turns any room into a live canvas where you can visualize changes, test ideas, and make confident decisions before you buy, build, or hire."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://www.ariaspark.com/privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Aria Spark", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.ariaspark.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1063584910766706"}, {"id": "393222478507326"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED_FOR_SOME_CONTENT", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["HAND_TRACKING", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "sup